[{"title":"和靖观梅","author":"胡奎","text":"花前立鹤小如童，天锡湖山属此翁。\n留得黄昏旧时月，至今长照水仙宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕望钓鱼图","author":"胡奎","text":"磻溪手弄一丝秋，梦入非熊雪满头。\n钓得周家有何物，白鱼跃入后王舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题平远图","author":"胡奎","text":"白白春云著树飞，望中浑似米元晖。\n数家屋近溪边住，一片帆从日下归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松","author":"胡奎","text":"丹井西头只一个，香炉侧畔恰千株。\n何当著我坐盘石，童子扫花閒读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桃花画眉","author":"胡奎","text":"天台山下问刘郎，玉女纤蛾画得长。\n望断彩云无信息，春风吹落镜中央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞庭吹笛图","author":"胡奎","text":"洞庭吹笛君山青，龙作老翁来一听。\n夜深龙去笛声绝，但见月白天冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鸣鹤山人溪山卷","author":"胡奎","text":"鸣鹤仙人去不归，秋风凉到女萝衣。\n白云也是无心物，长傍溪山好处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鹰 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"搏击无心到草莱，山鸡野雉莫相猜。\n昂然立在空青外，遮莫人呼不下来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鹰 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"金眸玉爪气雄豪，閒向秋风刷羽毛。\n整顿锋棱十二翮，碧天万里海云高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鹰 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"羽衣凌乱菊花明，白石江头立晚晴。\n不待将军臂韝上，红绒绦掣紫金铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鹰 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"青天掷下决云儿，正是霜高俊捷时。\n自有鹏雏充一饱，山鸡野雉莫相疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题洗马图","author":"胡奎","text":"奚官半脱茜袍红，应是开元白发翁。\n老去不闻征战事，閒来洗马柳阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题三笑图 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"一时行过虎溪头，何事千年笑未休。\n山色水光无限思，至今人说晋风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题三笑图 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"一时行过虎溪东，笑倒庐山五老峰。\n说与柴桑陶靖节，攒眉不必更闻钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四皓图","author":"胡奎","text":"皓首庞眉本在山，紫芝歌断白云间。\n汉家可是无罗网，鸿鹄高飞自不还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹","author":"胡奎","text":"黄陵女儿玉一双，天寒洒泪落湘江。\n苍梧鸣凤无消息，翠影参差雪满窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹下美人","author":"胡奎","text":"天寒翠袖立盈盈，中有贞心玉琢成。\n明月满天骑白凤，有人传是许飞琼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红竹","author":"胡奎","text":"葛令丹砂九转功，夜来化作葛陂龙。\n飞向苍梧叶虞舜，赤霞晴射九疑峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧牛昼睡图","author":"胡奎","text":"草软坡平午树凉，人牛此际两相忘。\n曾知亦有无眠者，马上鸡声满路霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洗马图","author":"胡奎","text":"青骢浴罢出金堤，草软沙乾散玉蹄。\n明日早朝催立仗，晚凉牵过御沟西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题贾山人竹雀图","author":"胡奎","text":"翠竹丛边棘刺多，珍禽独立意如何。\n朝阳鸣凤巢阿阁，五采何曾触网罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜雨后待月","author":"胡奎","text":"雨后凉云度绛河，秋声偏著树头多。\n呼儿快扫阶前叶，整顿青天好月过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四马图","author":"胡奎","text":"闻说唐家五弟兄，羁金络玉出宫城。\n自从一马为龙去，辇路年年春草生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挟弹图","author":"胡奎","text":"公子翩翩出大堤，紫骝踏碎落花泥。\n少年莫打黄金弹，恐有慈乌树上栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花流水图","author":"胡奎","text":"参差烟雾隔楼台，千树桃花洞里开。\n春色可怜关不住，又随流水出山来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春东园雨后有作 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"十日春阴一日晴，晚来又见照泥星。\n西南风起三更后，吹落荼蘼雪满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春东园雨后有作 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"满庭风落白荼蘼，春色三分竟不知。\n睡起北窗閒看竹，又添无数锦绷儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移竹 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"人言醉日可移竹，我爱此君醒日多。\n昨日雨中分数个，不知醒醉复如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移竹 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"山蕉叶畔偏宜竹，借我南窗一夏凉。\n八尺簟纹清似水，秋声月色两相当。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汲井","author":"胡奎","text":"长夏东园无好雨，花根土脉不相和。\n朝来试灌铜瓶水，也与花神助力多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扫地","author":"胡奎","text":"林扉东向启明开，雨后呼儿扫绿苔。\n整顿一方无别物，夜凉只许月明来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠黄鸟图","author":"胡奎","text":"谁写嫣然玉一枝，金衣公子立多时。\n曾知斥鴳蓬蒿下，不识长安挟弹儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题克已斋","author":"胡奎","text":"何物名为克已斋，须从偏处克将来。\n等閒云雾都消散，荡荡青天白日开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云季昭 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"东墙隔树有书声，晚阁长歌坐月明。\n一队邻家小儿子，夜凉分得案头萤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云季昭 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"道人自是东方朔，分得西池玉色桃。\n别后好传青鸟信，大江谁道隔风涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云季昭 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"池草青青秋水深，杏花坛上坐鸣琴。\n日长自讲先天易，说破羲皇万古心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云季昭 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"素王宫中多种竹，每分凉影过西邻。\n多情只有云夫子，九载弹琴看好春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送云季昭 其五","author":"胡奎","text":"别日情多会日稀，嫩凉昨夜入秋衣。\n除书远近须相报，好付霜前白雁归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"胡奎","text":"洛阳无数牡丹开，不惜黄金买地栽。\n二十四人金谷友，更无一个看花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题太真梅边玩月图","author":"胡奎","text":"浴罢华清整佩环，蛾眉笑比月钩弯。\n梨园夜半吹羌笛，野鹿偷春过玉关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桂菊图","author":"胡奎","text":"送酒白衣来栗里，烧丹金井出淮南。\n露花风叶俱寥落，见画令人思不堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宁州太守 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"有人相见御门前，说道腰围减昔年。\n寄与烧丹句漏令，只今谁是地行仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宁州太守 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"白发秋风相别后，三年不寄一书来。\n书来却是他人字，放在床头不忍开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宁州太守 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"孟光曾共去时车，千里魂归不是家。\n肠断绮窗花自落，错教鹦鹉唤琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宁州太守 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"宁州太守近如何，不道离家是挽歌。\n昨日把诗看醉墨，伯牙弦断泪偏多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中夏日书事","author":"胡奎","text":"冬青花落雨涔涔，一日舒晴十日阴。\n也爱东园有生意，枇杷铸得万丸金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题水仙","author":"胡奎","text":"洛浦仙人玉佩珰，盈盈宛在水中央。\n明珠翠羽芳洲上，欲赠佳期远意长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨菊","author":"胡奎","text":"晚节孤高也自奇，此情惟有墨卿知。\n夜来酒醒寒无佘，不觉玄霜落砚池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"胡奎","text":"黄陵女儿佩明珰，骑得云间白凤凰。\n回首苍梧渺何处，凉阴堕地月如霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒江万里图","author":"胡奎","text":"万里寒江一镜开，棹郎何处放舟来。\n桃花春水明年长，浪静风恬及早回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题携琴访友","author":"胡奎","text":"两翁何处访知音，涧水松风总是琴。\n识得此中千古意，子期端合铸黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九","author":"胡奎","text":"今年两度黄花秋，浊醪可漉仍可篘。\n西风任尔吹乌帽，不管傍人笑白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄鹤山人画松","author":"胡奎","text":"黄鹤山头白云飞，黄鹤仙人去不归。\n一个长松深谷里，秋风吹老女萝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋徽庙桑燕图","author":"胡奎","text":"东风燕子尾毵毵，茧馆春明试浴蚕。\n回首桑田都变海，故巢烟雨满江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乐工汤子玉琵琶手卷 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"白发大梁汤子玉，偶于画像见风流。\n鹍弦一曲无人和，名落南州与北州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乐工汤子玉琵琶手卷 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"推手为琵却手琶，东家蝴蝶又西家。\n春风三十年前梦，飞绕梁王苑内花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乐工汤子玉琵琶手卷 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"梁王苑内歌明月，西子台前醉落花。\n昨夜海棠添蜡烛，今朝鹦䳇唤琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56996,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乐工汤子玉琵琶手卷 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"七尺乌藤手自扶，东风吹雪上头颅。\n梨园传得龙香拨，借问春愁拨得无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56997,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乐工汤子玉琵琶手卷 其五","author":"胡奎","text":"琼花高髻有于娘，一曲扬州独擅场。\n不有词人龚子敬，无人知有贺新凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56998,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题三笑图","author":"胡奎","text":"过溪三笑本无心，岂意流传直到今。\n涧水松风都是笑，白云依旧在东林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56999,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题回文梅花美人图","author":"胡奎","text":"花重妾心冰皎皎，妾怜花貌玉盈盈。\n鸦盘翠髻流云湿，瘦影寒依夜月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题回文脩竹美人图","author":"胡奎","text":"寒生翠袖迎风晚，黛抹蛾眉妒月弯。\n鸾影舞回秋水远，问人何处九嶷山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"江南正月一尺雪，南郭门前春水生。\n柳条快染黄金色，待我放船溪上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"今年腊前不见雪，开岁两度白纷纷。\n平明推户看庭树，一色梨花都是云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"急霰打窗鸣不止，坐剪红烛到三更。\n莫笑煮茶无小妾，也知扫雪小童清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"灯花巧缀蜻蜓眼，定有何人明日来。\n便借仙翁东郭履，溪南溪北看花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽知事陈仲信妻 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"无人不道孟光贤，结发相从十九年。\n风雨梨花寒食夜，绿窗弹折凤凰弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽知事陈仲信妻 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"芙蓉幕府在钱塘，一曲哀歌欲断肠。\n白发老姑堂上坐，何人洗手作羹汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何尹宅牡丹 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"一阑千叶牡丹花，移在能诗水部家。\n候吏不来公馆静，未知春色属谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何尹宅牡丹 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"牡丹花开蝴蝶飞，牡丹花落蝴蝶稀。\n河阳无数旧桃李，可恨看花人不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"映水曲","author":"胡奎","text":"江水澄澄照玉容，恰如明镜拭青铜。\n今朝试抹双眉黛，不觉银钗落水中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过嘉兴南湖","author":"胡奎","text":"湖树青青湖水流，鸳鸯飞过木兰舟。\n最怜今夜初三月，照见行人过秀州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪峰诗卷","author":"胡奎","text":"阿母一双金剪刀，为儿裁作上官袍。\n春梦恰如湘水阔，春愁更比雪峰高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江送友之京","author":"胡奎","text":"天清江树碧毵毵，千里秋风送去帆。\n饮散广文官舍酒，到京应是月初三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓闻莺","author":"胡奎","text":"春寒虚幌曙光低，睍睆流莺隔树啼。\n睡起捲帘寻不见，一声却在杏花西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东园漫兴 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"竹里开门稍向东，隔帘吹过杏花风。\n青苔一径无人迹，时有山禽啄晚红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东园漫兴 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"铜瓶汲水灌花根，幽事关心懒出门。\n检点棠梨明日放，呼儿先拟具山尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东园漫兴 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"社雨晴时燕燕归，牡丹池馆故巢非。\n怜渠也爱吾庐好，日日衔泥下上飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东园漫兴 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"洛阳二月百花红，金谷春閒步障空。\n何似诗家真富贵，蔷薇花列锦屏风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东园漫兴 其五","author":"胡奎","text":"长日南窗一卷书，更凭何物称閒居。\n睡魔也自相欺得，茶鼎熏炉尽破除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]